ess (on DL):</b></font></li><li><font face="arial"><b>Mileage from perm address to facility?:</b></font></li></ul><ul style="font-size: 12pt;"><li style="font-size: 12pt;"><b style="font-size: 12pt;">Date of Birth:&nbsp;</b><font face="arial">{!Contact.Birthdate}</font></li><li style="font-size: 12pt;"><b>Social Security Number:</b></li><li style="font-size: 12pt;"><b style="font-size: 12pt;">Covid Vaccination Status:&nbsp;</b><font face="arial">{!Contact.COVID_Vaccination_Status__c}</font></li></ul><ul style="font-size: 12pt;"><li><b>BILL RATE:</b></li></ul><ul style="font-size: 12pt;"><li style="font-size: 12pt;"><b>Why Hire This Candidate (Bio):</b></li></ul><ul style="font-size: 12pt;"><li><font face="arial"><b>Willing to accept auto-offer?:</b></font></li></ul></div>]]></td>
